{"id":"b33de2795b3c99bf","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/830_BL-代数逻辑.md","title":"830 BL-代数逻辑","display":"830_BL-代数逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。BL-代数项的原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0,\\quad 1,\\quad *,\\quad \\Rightarrow,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0,\\quad 1,\\quad *,\\quad \\Rightarrow,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与等式\">2. 项与等式</h1>\n<p>构造子类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}:\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}:\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mul},\\operatorname{res},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mul},\\operatorname{res},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}:\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eq}:\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{mul}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{mul}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{res}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{res}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{meet}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{meet}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{join}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{join}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{eq}(s,t):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{eq}(s,t):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元出现与替换\">3. 变元出现与替换</h1>\n<p>定义自由变元函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\cup\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\cup\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{one})=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{one})=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{mul}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{mul}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{res}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{res}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{meet}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{meet}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{join}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{join}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换集合与扩张算子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^{\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^{\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^{\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^{\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^{\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^{\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\)</span>，记其项扩张</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta=\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\theta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta=\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\theta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\theta(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\theta(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{zero}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{zero}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{one}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{one}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{mul}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{mul}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{mul}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{mul}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{res}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{res}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{res}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{res}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{meet}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{meet}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{join}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(\\operatorname{join}(s,t))\n=\n\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义项替换与等式替换：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t,\\theta)=\\widehat\\theta(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t,\\theta)=\\widehat\\theta(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t),\\theta)\n=\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\theta)(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\n=\\operatorname{eq}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t),\\theta)\n=\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\theta)(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\n=\\operatorname{eq}(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定排除条款：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t)=\\varnothing\\quad(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(t)=\\varnothing\\quad(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{BLA}}\\operatorname{eq}(s&#39;,t&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow s=s&#39;\\ \\text{且}\\ t=t&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{BLA}}\\operatorname{eq}(s&#39;,t&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow s=s&#39;\\ \\text{且}\\ t=t&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta\">\\(\\widehat\\theta\\)</span> 不需要 fresh 选择或捕获避免重命名；等式替换由上面的等式替换函数给出。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-BL-代数\">4. BL-代数</h1>\n<p>BL-代数为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B=(B,\\le,0,1,*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf B=(B,\\le,0,1,*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足下列全部条件。各分量类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\ne\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\le\\;\\subseteq B^2,\n\\quad\n0,1\\in B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\ne\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\le\\;\\subseteq B^2,\n\\quad\n0,1\\in B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee:B^2\\to B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee:B^2\\to B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 上偏序：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le a,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le a)\\Rightarrow a=b,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le c)\\Rightarrow a\\le c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le a,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le a)\\Rightarrow a=b,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le c)\\Rightarrow a\\le c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,\\le,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee)\">\\((B,\\le,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee)\\)</span> 是有界格：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\quad\na\\vee b=b\\vee a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\quad\na\\vee b=b\\vee a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\quad\n(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\quad\n(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\le a,\\quad a\\le1,\\quad\na\\le b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee b=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\le a,\\quad a\\le1,\\quad\na\\le b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee b=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,*,1)\">\\((B,*,1)\\)</span> 是交换幺半群：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a*b=b*a,\\qquad\n(a*b)*c=a*(b*c),\\qquad\na*1=1*a=a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a*b=b*a,\\qquad\n(a*b)*c=a*(b*c),\\qquad\na*1=1*a=a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>剩余条件为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a*b\\le c\\quad\\text{当且仅当}\\quad a\\le b\\Rightarrow c,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a*b\\le c\\quad\\text{当且仅当}\\quad a\\le b\\Rightarrow c,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>预线性：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\Rightarrow b)\\vee(b\\Rightarrow a)=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\Rightarrow b)\\vee(b\\Rightarrow a)=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可除性：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b=a*(a\\Rightarrow b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge b=a*(a\\Rightarrow b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异是本条目以 BL-代数等式为主对象，而不是 BL 命题公式取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的逻辑。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-项解释\">5. 项解释</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BLAlg}\">\\(\\mathsf{BLAlg}\\)</span> 为所有 BL-代数之类。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BLAlg}\">\\(\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BLAlg}\\)</span>，赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to B\">\\(\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to B\\)</span> 的解释满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\mathbf B)=B^{\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\mathbf B)=B^{\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{var}(x)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}=\\nu(x),\n\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{zero}⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}=0,\n\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{one}⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{var}(x)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}=\\nu(x),\n\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{zero}⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}=0,\n\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{one}⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{mul}(s,t)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}*\n⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{mul}(s,t)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}*\n⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{res}(s,t)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\Rightarrow\n⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{res}(s,t)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\Rightarrow\n⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{meet}(s,t)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\wedge\n⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{meet}(s,t)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\wedge\n⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{join}(s,t)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\vee\n⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{join}(s,t)⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\vee\n⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-等式后承\">6. 等式后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B,\\nu\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf B,\\nu\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}=⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\">\\(⟦ s⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}=⟦ t⟧_{\\mathbf B,\\nu}^{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}e\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}e\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\">\\(e\\in\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\)</span>，且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BLAlg}\">\\(\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BLAlg}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to B\">\\(\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to B\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall g\\in\\Gamma\\,\\mathbf B,\\nu\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}g\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathbf B,\\nu\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}e.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall g\\in\\Gamma\\,\\mathbf B,\\nu\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}g\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathbf B,\\nu\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}e.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义等式有效集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\n\\{e\\in\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}:\\varnothing\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\n\\{e\\in\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}:\\varnothing\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-反例证书\">7. 反例证书</h1>\n<p>反例证书类定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf B,\\nu):\n\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BLAlg},\\\n\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\mathbf B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf B,\\nu):\n\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BLAlg},\\\n\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\mathbf B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall g\\in\\Gamma\\,\\mathbf B,\\nu\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}g,\n\\quad\n\\mathbf B,\\nu\\not\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall g\\in\\Gamma\\,\\mathbf B,\\nu\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}g,\n\\quad\n\\mathbf B,\\nu\\not\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)\n=\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)\n=\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}(\\Gamma,e)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式证明规则关系声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\\varnothing\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\\varnothing\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不定义证明对象。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>BL-代数逻辑为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{BLAlg},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathsf T}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathsf E}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{BLAlg},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\)</span> 仅由本条目的 BL-代数结构、项解释和等式真值定义；不得把 BL 命题逻辑的有效式集合或 Hilbert 规则隐式加入。</p>\n<p>该系统只含 BL-代数项、等式、替换、BL-代数结构和等式语义后承；不含命题 Hilbert 系统或语义完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与等式","text":"2. 项与等式","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元出现与替换","text":"3. 变元出现与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-BL-代数","text":"4. BL-代数","level":1},{"id":"5.-项解释","text":"5. 项解释","level":1},{"id":"6.-等式后承","text":"6. 等式后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-反例证书","text":"7. 反例证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\quad 1,\\quad *,\\quad \\Rightarrow,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.","display":true},{"tex":"\\approx","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}:\\mathsf{Var}_{\\mathsf{BLA}}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\mathsf{BLA}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{mul},\\operatorname{res},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{